In this project we separated the programing into three parts
1. The image recognition
2. The user interaction
3. The poker game win rate and decision making algorithm

To run this program, user need to run the poker_upload.py and start with entering the initial pot amount and two cards in hand by entering the images paths
The image recognition program will predict the cards in uploaded images
Then the poker algorithm will run simulations to find the win rate and output suggested decision using existing information
